Package: armatos-boot-theme
Version: 2779.1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: plymouth
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Armatos boot menu and splash
 The GRUB theme (a frosted marble tablet carried by the Atlas giants) and the
 Plymouth splash (the emblem, a gold progress rule, and the Tessera prompt
 for the LUKS passphrase). Works with Secure Boot: every word on the menu is
 drawn into images, since the signed GRUB cannot load fonts. On an installed
 system the kernel entries become carved tablets too: newest kernel, the one
 before it, recovery, and firmware setup.
